your prayer timeout becomes rnz(350), which is
tmp=(1000+rn2(1000)) * rne(4)
then a 50/50 chance of 350 *tmp/1000 or 350*1000/tmp

where rne(4) returns n with probability (3/4)^n, except
that its limited by 5 or [your level /3] (whichever is less), minimum of 1.

So for 

lvl < 6    its limited to 700
6<=lvl<9   its limited to 1400
9<=lvl<12  its limited to 2100
12<=lvl<15 its limited to 2800
15<=lvl    its limited to 3500 

[these calculations come from reading rnd.c, and I may have made a mistake,
 but I think they are right...]

